  "description": "A fully-fledged C# dialect of SQL — fluent, type-safe SELECT and DML (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE) for .NET 6+. Covers every ANSI SQL clause with full identifier quoting for SQL Server, MySQL/MariaDB, SQLite, PostgreSQL, and ANSI Generic dialects. Configure once at startup via QBuilderConfig, use named configs for multiple databases. Produces parameterized SQL strings you execute with Dapper, ADO.NET, or any micro-ORM. Zero boilerplate, injection-safe, 174 tests.",
