  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v9.1.0 — Dialect + config registry. New: QBuilderConfig.ConfigureDefault/Configure/Reset, QBuilderOptions (Dialect, TableNameResolver, AliasPrefix), Q.New(string name)/Q.New(QBuilderOptions). Dialect enum: None, SqlServer/MsSql, MySql, MariaDb, Sqlite, Postgres, Generic. Identifier quoting flows to every builder (SELECT, JOIN, WHERE, ORDER BY, GROUP BY, paging, DML). UsePageBy<TTable,TField>() auto-dispatches to correct paging strategy for the configured dialect. All 174 tests pass.",
